This directory contains a 20,000-character excerpt from

    Alice's Adventures in Wonderland, by Lewis Carroll (1865)

sourced from Project Gutenberg eBook #11, Millennium Fulcrum Edition 3.0
(https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/11).

Why it is here: the tests must be reproducible without network access, and a
character-level language model needs real text with real statistics to demonstrate
anything. This is the smallest fixture that supports the claim in the README.

The text is in the public domain in the United States. Project Gutenberg's terms
apply to the source edition, not to this excerpt's use here. Nothing else in this
repository is derived from it.
